{
  "page": 442,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3733,
      "text": "After his death, We did not send down any soldiers from heaven against his people, nor would We have done so.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 442,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3734,
      "text": "It was no more than a single blast, and immediately they were extinguished.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 442,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3735,
      "text": "Alas for the humans! No messenger ever comes to them but they ridicule him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 442,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3736,
      "text": "Do they not see how many generations We destroyed before them who will never come back to them[8]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 442,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3737,
      "text": "Yet all of them will be brought before Us.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 442,
      "ruku": 382,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3738,
      "text": "There is a sign for them in the dead land: We give it life and produce from it grain for them to eat.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 442,
      "ruku": 383,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3739,
      "text": "And We have made therein gardens of palm trees and grapevines, and caused springs to gush forth,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 442,
      "ruku": 383,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3740,
      "text": "so that they may eat of its fruit that was not made by their hands[9]. Will they not then give thanks?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 442,
      "ruku": 383,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3741,
      "text": "Glory be to the One Who created all types of things[10] that the earth produces, and of themselves, and of things that they have no knowledge about.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 442,
      "ruku": 383,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3742,
      "text": "There is another sign for them in the night: We strip from it the daylight, and they are left in darkness.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 442,
      "ruku": 383,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3743,
      "text": "The sun is running to its determined course. That is the design of the All-Mighty, All-Knowing.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 442,
      "ruku": 383,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3744,
      "text": "As for the moon, We have determined phases for it, until it becomes like an old palm stalk.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 442,
      "ruku": 383,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3745,
      "text": "It is not for the sun to catch up with the moon, nor for the night to outstrip the day. Each is floating in its own orbit.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 36,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يسٓ",
        "englishName": "Yaseen",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Yaseen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 83,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 442,
      "ruku": 383,
      "hizbQuarter": 177,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
